Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,=======TEXT=======
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}38.3度…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.69,0:01:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}比昨天稍微低了点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天整天都要这样好好睡着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}穗波 妈妈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.47,0:01:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她上完夜班回来之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.89,0:01:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就出去买东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快递？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.40,0:01:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我稍微出去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.19,0:02:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个 我们是来看望海果的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.30,0:02:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个…虽然我不知道你们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但如果你们是来捉弄姐姐的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.65,0:02:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还请等她康复之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊？什么啊 我看起来像是来找茬的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么看都是找茬的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}突然来打扰真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}昨天 海果在社团活动时突然晕倒…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.22,0:02:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我收到海果他们社团同学的消息了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.81,0:02:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她们还带海果去医院了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.89,0:02:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有朋友在一起真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这么说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个…我从妈妈那里听说了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.73,0:02:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.13,0:02:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}吓到你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.57,0:02:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}姐姐原来真的有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没想到那家伙竟然真的是姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.83,0:02:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}姐姐 我要进来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你社团的同学来看你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.03,0:02:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}完全没注意到你的身体不好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.19,0:03:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我真是个烂到不行的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}来吧 多吸入一点宇宙能量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明内同学…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.68,0:03:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Supiiv！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Supiiv!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的是姐姐的朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.95,0:03:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们是友raav！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}别说外星语了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她等会又要瞎想了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家能来看我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.51,0:03:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好像是感冒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}应该好好睡一觉就差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.43,0:03:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.53,0:03:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们买来了好多好多好吃的果冻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}多吃点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么说呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.03,0:03:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可能是我让你太勉强了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.88,0:03:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要再在一起…做火箭哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}知道了知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.89,0:03:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以那你就快点好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬的脸怎么有点小红呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不会是感冒了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我来试试你有没有发烧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}走开
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.98,0:04:11.29,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就让我试一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}吵架就去外面吵
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.29,0:04:13.00,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我说了走开的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.37,0:04:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}现在要喝粥吗
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.00,0:04:15.05,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬简直就是个暴脾气外星人
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.05,0:04:16.00,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}闭嘴 天丸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}额头 感觉舒服了不少呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}为什么是连我也要做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下一个让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好意思 带了这么多人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.85,0:04:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个 能帮我忙 多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天你父母都在工作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妈妈刚刚回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但又出去买东西去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妈妈在水族馆工作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.11,0:04:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有时候还会值夜班…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}昨天晚上因为姐姐我也没睡好觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是个好妹妹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.41,0:04:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:04:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哎呀呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}站着也能睡着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是有她姐姐没有的干练呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.94,0:05:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}乖 乖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}既然如此 就把我的胳膊借给你用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不 你去把会长的冷头贴给换了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好吧 我来把这孩子安置到沙发上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.25,0:05:21.77,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬 你要过来帮我做饭哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}额头…好烫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}帮帮我 明内…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.24,0:05:49.43,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感应…感应~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遥乃感应 瞬感应
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遥乃感应 瞬感应
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个 明内同学…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.07,0:06:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还 还有…我的额头呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶 海果你不是说不想要额门感应吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.60,0:06:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以和海果的话 是绝对不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天和遥乃再做一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.23,0:06:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喂喂 不要把我漏了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就让瞬来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好狡猾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}烧得好像…更厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是辛苦你了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}多亏了海果你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家才能重新再聚到一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.41,0:06:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看 就跟我和你说过的一样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果已经成为一个出色的会长了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}抱歉 把你弄醒了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.15,0:06:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明内同学…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.65,0:06:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你有什么想吃的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遥乃和瞬她们刚…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幽 冷头贴换过了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果她怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幽 你的脸怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}发烧了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.81,0:07:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这 这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想和你做…额门感应
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为我…所以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只能和我做…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}额门…额门…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天的额门都卖完了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是…也没人想买啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下一次补货是什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下一次…下一次…下一次是…
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.95,0:07:58.16,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.07,0:08:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}额门…好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明明今天有客人来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}姐姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}总之 恭喜海果会长痊愈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}麻烦大家担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感冒能好真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然后是瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}恭喜瞬复学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这种话就不用说了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}让人怪别扭的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雷门同学 真的是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}别给我摆那种让人肉麻表情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的 老师一整天都对我不温不火的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雷门 上课不可以溜号哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}笑原老师一直都很担心你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你这个表里不一的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才是最表里如一的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}信不信把你的额门打飞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不要突然松手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.47,0:09:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幽 从去看海果的时候开始
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.51,0:09:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就有点不对劲了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.99,0:09:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}难…难道你被我传染了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不 不是 不…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么说呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.29,0:09:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}额头…在燃烧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都说了不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个 那个 这个先不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.57,0:09:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下来 应该是火箭研究同好会的重启仪式吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}别转移话题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果会长
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下来的活动内容是？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.37,0:09:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯…这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.99,0:10:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}之前的气势都去哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}让我们再一起去追逐天空吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.59,0:10:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我们还有好多目标
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}得一件一件慢慢考虑…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}总 总之 我认为得先把明年的锦标赛搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}得一年之后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在 在那之前…我们得必须先被学校认可…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然后晋升为社团…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如 如果一直是同好会的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}申请发射场所会非常困难…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不危险吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且…也不能把所有的工作…都放在这地下做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还有资金…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.41,0:10:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们为什么不在学校发射火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好让老师们都大吃一惊呢
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.75,0:10:52.01,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}记下 记下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你是想废部吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}回顾过去的例子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:11:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也有外来植物研究会 通过植物科学研究的比赛的奖项
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而被升为正式社团的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}外来…？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}记下记下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们怎么可能依靠那种虚幻的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好刻薄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且我们自掏腰包做到现在的模型火箭 也可以有效活用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}记下记下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}让我们给地方的小比赛 掀起一场风暴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.25,0:11:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.71,0:11:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我查过过往的成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要把回收的火箭循环利用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.59,0:11:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就可以轻易入围了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}用最短的路线升格致胜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.31,0:11:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然后怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在明年的锦标赛让立冈的家伙哭出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这边才是本心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在 在小比赛中拿出成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然后在全国大赛上击败…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.18,0:11:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}停停
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个不用写的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个说到底只是我的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.35,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不用把它列为同好会的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.55,0:12:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我想赋予自己做的东西一些意义
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只能做出自己不满意的成绩的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}记录一直空缺什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.27,0:12:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在明年的锦标赛我也会复仇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是为了我的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而参加这个同好会的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以会长也的要问问自己想要的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.18,0:12:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然后考虑接下来同好会的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可别像之前一样 考虑一些奇怪的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而自顾自消沉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}自己的…目标
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.47,0:12:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想能…普通地和别人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我一直…在反 反思 锦 锦标赛的演讲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.27,0:12:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想着「如果能说得更好」就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果一直放任着不擅长的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那 那这以后一定会有更多失败
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我不想以后眼里都是那 那样的失败
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.26,0:12:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}加上这些
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:13:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我想成为一个好的会长
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这就是我现在的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.31,0:13:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是 我是说了「问问自己想要的」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}目标是交流能力什么的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}跟同 同好会没什么关系 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们会帮你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我呢 其实还没找到像大家一样的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果和瞬有想实现的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幽也有要回自己母星的大目标
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.89,0:13:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我还没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说过「我不会有能发自内心喜欢的东西」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}刚才的也只是现学现卖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.97,0:13:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以如果有我能做的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我都想去努力试试
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.05,0:13:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然后如果在这个过程中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能找到属于自己的东西的话就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我会把大家的意见都统合起来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}重新想活动计划的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}按我们的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.73,0:14:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}脚踏实地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.38,0:14:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去为了那枚可以到达天际的火箭去努力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.64,0:14:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天也要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小之果同学 Bona早~
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欧 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}早上avuu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}趋 趋之以视 见其筒中 中 有光出矣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.85,0:14:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}更 更复察斯 则有美人 身长三寸 居 居于其中
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.67,0:14:46.70,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小之星同学
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}注意呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好 好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果在努力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.45,0:15:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}模型火箭锦标赛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.20,0:15:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}全国大赛二连霸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}立冈科学技术高中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}安如磐石的发射
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不愧是王者风范
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.12,0:15:10.05,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.05,0:15:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}制胜全国大赛 好帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.10,0:15:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}立冈是…是那个理科学校吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.39,0:15:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是在预选赛和小之星同学们龙争虎斗过的队伍哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.65,0:15:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好厉害呀 小之果同学
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.62,0:15:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是 我们一点都不厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.13,0:15:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只输了一屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}昨 昨天看了决赛的直播后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我给秋 秋月前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.76,0:15:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}发了祝贺信息
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.31,0:15:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她说这个就是优胜的奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.76,0:15:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.30,0:15:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明年我们要变得更强
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然后一起去决赛比拼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.91,0:15:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.57,0:15:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家在看什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}梨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:15:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是模型火箭的发射录像
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.05,0:16:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}火箭？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是用火药的引擎发射的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.81,0:16:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.31,0:16:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}木梨同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.87,0:16:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}平时她都会来和我搭话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.31,0:16:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是因为我不中用
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.11,0:16:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一次交流都没有成功过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感觉好乏味呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.11,0:16:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一点也不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呐！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一点也不乏味啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.55,0:16:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小之果同学她们也在玩的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.07,0:16:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对啊！老是突然说这种话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.64,0:16:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}实际上确实是有点乏味吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.55,0:16:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但就是这点好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.17,0:16:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}模型火箭现在很流行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.43,0:16:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对吧 小之星同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.84,0:16:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这种时候不正是宣传你们活动的绝好机会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我想能…普通地和别人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}木 木梨同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}模 模型火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虽然准备的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:16:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可 可能是有些无趣和乏味
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但 发射的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被小之星同学叫名字了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.32,0:17:02.69,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}会非常迅猛的飞上天空
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.69,0:17:03.38,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么说呢…
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.38,0:17:05.25,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}非常帅的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我今天…也带了实物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.29,0:17:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我…可 可能被木梨同学…讨厌了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.13,0:17:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}毕竟说了那么多 就像个狂热粉丝似的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.08,0:17:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不能这么说 瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}肯定没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}梨她都有认真在听的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}认真在听…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.06,0:17:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}确 确实…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.61,0:17:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我在说的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}木梨同学听到一半就一言不发了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}思考已经游离天外了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.73,0:17:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬 不能这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}梨也说了后面会看录像的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对啊对啊 而且还交换了联络方式
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.17,0:17:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}把录像的网址传给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}话说我们有交换联络方式吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.39,0:18:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明明就坐在前后位置的 却现在才交换
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虽然被她笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.15,0:18:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过能交换到 真好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.47,0:18:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}开始社团会议吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是这股气势 海果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.97,0:18:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被期待了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要回点什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们也发点照片过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}照…
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.22,0:18:35.50,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喂 别把镜头对着我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好开心的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.32,0:18:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哦 天已经那么黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}已经到天黑得更早的季节了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明 明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.25,0:18:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明内同学
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:19:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那 那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我有 有 有东西忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你 你们先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果她 真的 变得坚强了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为我想找到自己的归宿
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.42,0:19:22.58,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你的护目镜好酷！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.58,0:19:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没问题的
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.65,0:19:26.47,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我想应该全都传达到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对 对不起…我没有做好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}让我们一起朝着天空努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那家伙一直都很坚强的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.87,0:19:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}额头好热
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}飞走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 找到明内同学了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.62,0:19:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海 海果？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.87,0:19:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还 还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}难道是一直
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}身体有什么不舒服的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.95,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没 没有那种事的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.87,0:20:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可能是宇宙能量变得不安定了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不 不要勉强哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.63,0:20:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有什么需要的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我会带过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.55,0:20:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过不过 我可是活力满满的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不用在意的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.73,0:20:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}额 额头有些凉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.11,0:20:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虽然明日同学平时都有些凉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明日同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.31,0:20:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的一点事都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}额头感应
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.51,0:20:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只和我一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.24,0:20:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都是因为海果说那种话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.37,0:20:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个 今天 我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.81,0:20:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是…没和任何人做…额头感应吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.70,0:20:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶 嗯…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对…吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是今天的第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.97,0:20:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明…内同…学？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你的脸…很红哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.46,0:21:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哔卟哔卟…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.54,0:21:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}果 果然身体不舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不不不 没事了没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.36,0:21:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明 明内同学
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.39,0:21:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我稍 稍微借一下额头
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.31,0:21:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.59,0:21:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果这么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这么关心着我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.37,0:21:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么…样了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我接收到了很多 海果的关心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.95,0:21:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.05,0:21:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一直都是这样对我直抒胸臆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.36,0:21:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}又耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.47,0:21:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还闪闪亮亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.98,0:22:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}非常温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.61,0:22:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还记得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.99,0:22:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果第一次给我自我介绍的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.15,0:22:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.65,0:22:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}将来的梦想是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}开着自己做的宇宙飞船去往太空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.93,0:22:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去宇宙里寻找外星人的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.90,0:22:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}外星人的同伴…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.99,0:22:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.58,0:22:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}坐大家制作的火箭去往宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.23,0:22:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是我现在的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.23,0:22:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一直以来都谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.80,0:22:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明内同学
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我会努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.51,0:22:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虽然还不太…靠谱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.87,0:22:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.69,0:22:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没有啦 海果的话一定可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.01,0:22:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.77,0:22:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}绝对要一起去宇宙！
